error[L0520]: the result of `greeter` keeps a borrow of a local of its argument
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_a_part_of_a_loop_binder_that_borrows_a_temporary.knv:6:52
  |
1 | (defn greeter (name)
  |                ---- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `name`
...
6 |         extended-half (greeter (loop (p (pair (ref (str "zz")) (as-str s)))
  |                                                    ^^^^^^^^^^ this value is dropped at the end of its block, while the result still borrows it
  |
  = help: bind the argument with `let` before the statement that binds the result, so it lives as long as the result
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation

